# Hyperbolic residues
# Difference-of-squares contours flow through a modular period.

:mim 1

:param phase number = 0
:vary phase from 0 to 31 over 10s loop

:axis x integers
:axis y integers

# x² - y² forms hyperbolas instead of the circles made by x² + y².
:field mod((x + phase) * (x + phase) - y * y, 31)
:lens value

# Magnitude coloring keeps the moving contour depth legible.
:color magnitude(lens)
:overlay equality off
